
h1 Search and passage API

h2 Example: search a drive
curl -X POST "$POLYGRES_BASE_URL/v1/drives/$DRIVE_ID/search" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $POLYGRES_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: refund-question-1" \
  -d '{"query":"How do refunds work?","effort":"small"}'

h2 Folder selection

h2 Example response
{
  "request_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "drive_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "model": "wondersearch-1.1",
  "effort_requested": "medium",
  "effort_served": "medium",
  "results": [{
    "document_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
    "external_id": "handbook",
    "document_revision": "1",
    "passage_id": "example-passage",
    "row_id": "1",
    "text": "Refunds are available within 30 days.",
    "start_byte": 0,
    "end_byte": 37,
    "metadata": {"edition": 1},
    "score": 0.8
  }],
  "usage": {"cost": {"amount": "0.002500", "currency": "USD"}},
  "warnings": []
}

h2 Read the response

h2 Effort, notices, and charges

h2 Request validation

h3 Query text

h2 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/search
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
query | string | Required | Nonempty question or search text. Questions have a length limit. Shorten or rephrase on query_too_long or invalid_search_query; ask in English on unsupported_language.
effort | small, medium, large | Optional | Default: "medium"
folder_id | UUID string, "root", or null | Optional | UUID: direct documents in that folder. "root": documents without a folder. Omitted or null: whole drive.
allow_degraded | boolean | Optional | Defaults to false. Allow reduced-quality results for at most the Small price; otherwise incomplete searches return an unbilled error.
group_by_document | boolean | Optional | Default: true
timeout_ms | integer | Optional | Minimum: 1. Maximum: 20000. Omission uses the selected effort’s default time limit.
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
request_id | string | Yes | uuid
drive_id | string | Yes | uuid
model | string | Optional | Product version used for this search.
effort_requested | small, medium, large | Optional | Requested setting.
effort_served | small, medium, large | Optional | Setting used to fulfill the request.
results | array of object | Yes | Display in returned order.
results[].document_id | string | Yes | uuid
results[].external_id | string | Yes | 
results[].document_revision | string | Yes | 
results[].passage_id | string | Yes | 
results[].row_id | string | Yes | Decimal digits. Index reference for the passage; use passage_id to identify passages.
results[].text | string | Yes | 
results[].start_byte | integer | Yes | Minimum: 0
results[].end_byte | integer | Yes | Minimum: 0
results[].metadata | object | Yes | 
results[].score | number | Yes | 
usage | object | Yes | 
usage.cost | object | Yes | 
usage.cost.amount | string | Yes | 
usage.cost.currency | "USD" | Yes | 
warnings | array of string | Yes | 

h2 GET /v1/drives/{drive_id}/passages/{passage_id}
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
passage_id | path | string | Yes
index_snapshot_id | query | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
document_id | string | Yes | uuid
external_id | string | Yes | 
document_revision | string | Yes | 
passage_id | string | Yes | 
row_id | string | Yes | Decimal digits. Index reference for the passage; use passage_id to identify passages.
text | string | Yes | 
start_byte | integer | Yes | Minimum: 0
end_byte | integer | Yes | Minimum: 0
metadata | object | Yes | 
score | number | Yes | 
index_snapshot_id | string | Yes | uuid

h2 GET /v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/capabilities
Name | Location | Value | Required
workspace_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
search_enabled | boolean | Yes | 
models | array of string | Yes | Supported WonderSearch product versions.
default_model | string | Yes | Product version currently served.
enabled_efforts | array of small, medium, large | Yes | 
effort_config | object | Yes | 
effort_config.small | object | Yes | 
effort_config.small.timeout_ms | integer | Yes | Minimum: 1. Maximum: 20000
effort_config.medium | object | Yes | 
effort_config.medium.timeout_ms | integer | Yes | Minimum: 1. Maximum: 20000
effort_config.large | object | Yes | 
effort_config.large.timeout_ms | integer | Yes | Minimum: 1. Maximum: 20000

